WEBVTT

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:15.870
February 28th. Sunny.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.750
Today, I finally revealed a long kept secret.

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:41.150
Kagami, Kagami!

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:45.530
What do you want? I'm busy.

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:47.150
Um... You see...

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:49.400
The thing is, Kagami...

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:51.030
Let's be friends!

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.790
Don't go back to sleep! I'm being serious here!

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.550
I get the feeling that it'll be a huge pain in the butt, so I want no part of it.

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:10.090
Hear me out.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:13.390
You know how I transferred here in the middle of the semester?

00:01:13.390 --> 00:01:16.510
On top of that, I'm the homeroom teacher's little sister,
so naturally everyone treats me differently.

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.810
Then my dumb brother says,

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:21.690
"Sasami-san's such a sad little girl. She shut herself away for ages,"

00:01:21.690 --> 00:01:26.190
as if something terrible had happened to me, so nobody tried to get close!

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:29.360
So now everyone's keeping their distance from me,

00:01:29.360 --> 00:01:31.450
and when they are around me,
they act super careful.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.530
I try talking to them, but we only ever have dull, reserved conversations.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:36.740
They're as stiff as boards whenever we talk.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.290
You are indeed correct.

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:41.120
I sincerely apologize. I failed to notice that.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:43.960
You're stiffer and more reserved than any of them!

00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:46.960
Anyway, I want to have a normal school life!

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:48.460
I want a normal life!

00:01:48.840 --> 00:01:53.090
But there's only one month left until my first year of high school ends.

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:57.220
I don't see how that relates to you wanting to form a friendship with me.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:01.850
First, I want to befriend people like you to make it seem like I'm...

00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:04.100
a smiley, cheerful girl!

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.360
I plan to give people that sort of image of me

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.570
so that, eventually, everyone will feel comfortable talking to me.

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:13.320
The roundabout way you're explaining this and that mention of "people like me" bother me.

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:14.240
Please!

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:17.120
I've never had a friend before.

00:02:17.830 --> 00:02:21.370
I have no idea about how to make one.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.080
Uh, so what I'm saying is...

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:26.630
I want to use you to practice making friends!

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.130
You already know a little about me,

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:33.760
so it makes things a little easier.

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.970
I thought you'd be a good person to use as practice!

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:38.470
Like, a shortcut to friends.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:43.100
Are you aware of how despicable
a human being you currently appear to be?

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:45.310
Please, Kagami!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:49.570
Very well. I will do what I can.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:50.730
Really?

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:55.410
So, now that we're friends, please show me some consideration and let me sleep.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.070
Sure. We're friends, after all!

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.530
All right! Sleep well!

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:00.700
You're too loud. Please silence yourself.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.580
Okay!

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:10.210
And that is how I made my first friend.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.640
Kagami, Kagami!

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:51.060
It's lunch break!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:52.900
Class is over. Wake up!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:55.530
What do you want this time?

00:04:55.530 --> 00:04:57.400
Let's have lunch together.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:04:58.610
Why should we?

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.780
You're asking me why?

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:01.740
Because we're friends, of course!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.910
I'm built in such a way that eating is not required to survive.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:11.960
As such, I want to nap in peace during lunch break, a time when I'm allowed to sleep.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.340
It's not like you don't nap the rest of the time!

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:17.090
It'd be strange for friends not to have lunch together.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:21.890
Then I'll put our desks together, so you can eat whatever you brought for lunch.

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.220
I'll just sleep.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:25.560
That'll make me feel even lonelier!

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:27.020
I didn't bring lunch today.

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:27.810
Let's go to the cafeteria!

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.310
Ugh, you're so annoy—

00:05:30.690 --> 00:05:33.190
Actually, I will accompany you.

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:34.560
We're friends, after all.

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.190
G-Go, Tsukuyomi!

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.700
You're our only hope!

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:43.200
D-Don't lose!

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.080
Bring me another bowl!

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.240
Coming.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.670
We're not going to go down like this!

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.840
She may look small, but she's a monster!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.880
What are they doing?

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:00.840
My sister is here.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:08.600
Oh, he's done for.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:12.440
That was good.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.190
What are you doing, Nee-san?

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:18.110
As you can see, we had an eating contest.

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:21.690
They agreed to pay for everything I eat at the cafeteria if I won!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.200
And what did you bet?

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:25.110
A kiss on the cheek.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:31.250
It shows you how foolish practically all men—

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:32.460
Kagami?!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.920
I'm so sorry! Are you okay?

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:37.420
There is no need for you to apologize.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.880
It was an accident.

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.550
Please excuse me, Sasami-san.

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:44.010
I am going to change my clothes,
so you'll have to eat lunch by yourself.

00:06:45.390 --> 00:06:47.140
Kagami...

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:52.520
Hey, Kagami.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.310
What is it this time?

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:58.400
Since we're friends now, you should do something with me instead of sleeping!

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:01.940
Okay. You may spend as much time in my company as you desire.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:04.110
While you do, I'll be taking a nap.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:07.160
And what am <i>I</i> supposed to do?

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.740
Kagami, let's go to the restroom!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.120
What?

00:07:11.120 --> 00:07:14.960
You still can't go by yourself at your age?

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:16.500
That's not it!

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.300
I've always dreamed of walking hand-in-hand with a friend to the restroom!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.710
We're girls, and we're friends! We've got to do it!

00:07:22.710 --> 00:07:25.680
A robot such as myself has no need for that place.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:27.390
Don't be so cold.

00:07:27.390 --> 00:07:29.180
You can wait outside if you want.

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:30.890
Well, I'm not going inside.

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:33.270
Kagami…

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.890
We're friends, right?

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.490
I just don't see the point of doing this.

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.950
No complaining!

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:51.080
Also, this way, other people can see I've got a friend!

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.830
This friendship "practice" is getting ridiculous.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.710
Oh?

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.300
What's the matter?

00:08:02.300 --> 00:08:03.500
I stepped on something.

00:08:07.010 --> 00:08:10.050
No wonder I sensed stimulation in the soles of my feet.

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:11.430
Doesn't it hurt?

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:12.760
It's fine.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.770
I'm not human, so this isn't enough to—

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:16.730
Kagami!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.270
...make me feel pain.

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:28.780
Kagami!

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:33.740
It appears that today is just not my day.

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:35.790
You'll have to empty your bowels on your own.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.040
O-Okay.

00:08:40.420 --> 00:08:43.550
So for now, Kagami and I have become friends.

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:45.300
Oh, I want salmon next.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.710
Got it.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.090
Kagami gets good grades even though she's always sleeping.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.340
I only want half of the rice.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:52.300
Got it.

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.310
Apparently, she can memorize whole textbooks just looking at them.

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.980
She has no problem doing arithmetic with seven-digit numbers in her head.

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:58.850
No wasabi.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:08:59.560
Got it.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.560
She's so high-spec.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.770
Maybe I should ask her to help me study.

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:05.570
I'll kill you if you get soy sauce on the rice.

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:06.650
Got it.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:14.030
Yep, delicious.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:17.080
Kagami said she used to be a robot with no will of her own.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:17.620
Tea.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:18.750
Got it.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:23.040
She was built from parts of Tsurugi by an evil organization,

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:26.250
but Tsurugi took her back and, as they worked together,

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:28.170
emotions began springing forth inside her.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:29.300
Blow on it first.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:35.510
So, those emtions not being fully developed may be the reason Kagami seems cold sometimes.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.430
Or could it be...

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.560
Sasami-san...

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:38.270
What is it?

00:09:38.270 --> 00:09:41.440
Why is it that all you're talking about is Kagami-san?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:46.270
How come you never mention me or even just tweet about me?

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.190
What?

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:51.700
Sasami-san, please... Please... Please...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:55.120
Please eat me!

00:09:55.120 --> 00:09:58.410
I'm the one who can love you the most!

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.540
Wh-What...

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:03.290
Sushi doesn't belong on your nipples!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.050
Don't do embarrassing things like that in public!

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:10.380
Okay. I'll only do them at home from now on.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.880
Not at home, either!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:13.890
And you shouldn't do it again, anyway!

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:15.140
Jeez, you're such a...

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.560
What's wrong, Sasami-san?

00:10:23.650 --> 00:10:24.400
Kagami!

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:26.310
Are you all right, Kagami?

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:27.150
What's the matter?

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.440
Oh, you two.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.650
Are you on your way home now?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.650
Now's not the time for small talk!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:33.860
You need to get to a hospital right away.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:35.240
There's no need to worry.

00:10:35.820 --> 00:10:38.830
Unlike you humans, I have a sturdy body.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:41.000
I will quickly recover.

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:42.250
What happened?

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:45.250
I was just sleeping.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.500
Tell me what happened! We're friends, aren't we?

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:50.340
This has nothing to do with you.

00:10:51.970 --> 00:10:57.100
Could you only try to be friends with me on school grounds?

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:01.850
You're just using me to practice making friends, after all.

00:11:02.230 --> 00:11:04.810
I don't know what confused you as to what our relationship is,

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:06.600
but your advances are really becoming bothersome.

00:11:13.320 --> 00:11:14.360
Kagami...

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:20.240
Kagami!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.270
Uh, Kagami?

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.310
Kagami?

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.940
Do you need something?

00:11:49.940 --> 00:11:53.480
Um, I won some movie tickets.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:56.280
Do you want to go with me?

00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:58.990
Sorry, but today I have a prior engagement.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.580
When will you be free?

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.200
Wanna go hang out somewhere?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.910
It doesn't have to be the movies.

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:05.910
I'm sorry...

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.880
but could you refrain from making such requests for now?

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:16.550
Um, am I annoying?

00:12:16.550 --> 00:12:17.130
No.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:24.890
My life and daily routines are not affected in the slightest by your existence.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.650
Well then, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:36.900
That's enough.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.910
Forget it!

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:11.560
Really, Yagami-san?

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:13.480
I've always wanted to talk to you.

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.400
Ask me anything. We're friends, after all.

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:19.450
That's great.

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.740
Hey, what kind of things do you like?

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:25.580
I can't... I can't stand this.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.760
<i>Yeah, I'll never get to live a normal life.</i>

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.800
<i>I'll never be an ordinary girl.</i>

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.970
<i>If I knew this would happen, I would've never left home.</i>

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:49.980
Ogre, follow the clapping and come get us!

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:51.230
Gotcha!

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:54.610
This smell is... Sacchin?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.690
I'll dig in then!

00:13:57.400 --> 00:14:00.280
Play with me too!

00:14:00.950 --> 00:14:01.950
Eat me too!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.200
Don't touch there!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.200
No, you got me!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.870
But I'm the weakest of the ogres!

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.080
Even if you defeat me, more will come and...

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.800
Huh? I smell Mamarin.

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:28.140
Mamarin, I'm playing tag blindfolded,

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:30.480
because I'm too good for regular tag!

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.060
Huh? It is you, right, Mamarin?

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.190
Why aren't you talking to me?

00:14:35.190 --> 00:14:36.610
Did I get the wrong person?

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.530
I wonder... Let's see...

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:43.070
Yep, you taste like Mamarin!

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:45.160
Huh? Are you crying, Mamarin?

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:52.460
Mamarin, let's play!

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:56.460
It's really dangerous when you're feeling sad.

00:14:56.460 --> 00:15:00.050
Gods around you will warp the world to make you feel better.

00:15:01.050 --> 00:15:06.220
And when you're sad, it hurts in my heart.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:09.680
Because I'm dumb, I don't really know what to do,

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.980
but I want to see you smiling!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:14.690
So let's play!

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:17.520
Okay.

00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:22.280
See you tomorrow!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.150
That's it. I'm too old for this.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:27.490
Did you have fun, Mamarin?

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.870
Let's play again!

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.370
If I ever feel like it, sure.

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:31.120
Great!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:35.670
Hey, Tama.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.670
How do I make friends?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:44.170
Why are you asking me something like that?

00:15:44.170 --> 00:15:47.180
Because I don't have any.

00:15:48.050 --> 00:15:50.930
But you're friends with Kagami-nee, right?

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:55.560
Kagami-nee was really happy she made a friend.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:56.690
Huh?

00:15:56.690 --> 00:16:00.020
She told us about practicing with you during PE,

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:02.940
and how she paired up with you during English class.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.200
It never shows on her face, but I could tell she was really happy!

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:11.030
Because we're gods, we always feel worried.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:16.790
Since we're gods, the things we want could cause a Transformation and make anyone be our friends.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.080
So we're afraid.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:23.550
Other kids might play with me and tell me they love me,

00:16:23.550 --> 00:16:27.550
but it might just be me forcing them to do that.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.050
Tama...

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:34.100
But because you and Kagami-nee are both gods, it's not a Transformation friendship

00:16:34.100 --> 00:16:36.560
but true friendship. I wish I had one too.

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:41.520
Mamarin, please stay good friends with Kagami-nee.

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:42.980
She'll be done with it soon.

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.690
She'll be done before the term ends.

00:16:45.030 --> 00:16:45.780
Huh?

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:49.950
She said it was one thing she had to take care of on her own.

00:16:51.200 --> 00:16:53.950
So wait for her, okay?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.210
Downloading talisman machine gun.

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.460
Inputting spiritual missiles.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:03.210
Setting the protection of the fire god Kagutsuchi to level B.

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:04.960
Activating the Holy Mirror.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.550
Uninstalling potential vulnerabilities and damaged functions.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:10.720
Putting mind and emotions into sleep mode.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:20.230
<i>So that's what was going on.</i>

00:17:20.230 --> 00:17:24.480
<i>The Countless Gods are currying the favor of the supreme god,</i>

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:28.360
<i>and right now, the supreme god is stupid old me.</i>

00:17:31.870 --> 00:17:37.620
<i>Of all things, I wished for a friend, and I chose Kagami.</i>

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:41.040
<i>That aroused the envy of the gods around us</i>

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:43.590
<i>and they began attacking her.</i>

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:48.210
<i>I used to be a puppet with no will of my own.</i>

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:52.800
<i>I was an automata built to achieve objectives in the most efficient manner possible.</i>

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.510
<i>But I found myself a family</i>

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:57.310
<i>and, perhaps, also a friend.</i>

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:06.650
<i>If I become her friend, the entire world will attack Kagami.</i>

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.820
<i>I don't care what comes my way.</i>

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:10.740
<i>If it is what my friend wishes for,</i>

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:14.370
<i>I'll gladly bloody myself so that she can stay normal and ordinary.</i>

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.540
<i>She said we should only be friends at school because</i>

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:21.290
<i>the best she could manage was to keep peace there.</i>

00:18:21.290 --> 00:18:23.750
<i>I'm not seeking appreciation.</i>

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.630
<i>I was just happy.</i>

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:29.210
<i>So, to save my friend unnecessary worries,</i>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.550
<i>I'll clean up this situation in secret.</i>

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.300
I'll send those who resist to hell!

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:35.850
<i>Just like she's my friend...</i>

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:36.800
One <i>hell</i> of a friend!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:43.770
Kagami....

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:52.320
You do <i>not</i> want to make me angry.

00:19:07.590 --> 00:19:08.340
Kagami...

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:13.760
What's the matter?

00:19:13.760 --> 00:19:16.470
It's too early to come to school.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:17.800
Look who's talking!

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:20.140
It's too late to stay at school.

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:23.850
I was taking a nap and ended up oversleeping.

00:19:25.100 --> 00:19:27.520
I saw you walking with some of our other classmates.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.610
Are they your friends?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:32.110
I don't have friends.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:38.120
They were possessed by evil gods, which I drove away.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:43.620
They were probably planning to settle inside humans in secret and approach you.

00:19:44.290 --> 00:19:48.630
You're just a child, so you wouldn't have noticed and would've been happy.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.260
You're so useless you would've been lured by evil gods

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:55.130
to cause us all great trouble by transforming the world.

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:58.140
You were worried about me.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:00.430
Did you listen to a word of what I just said?

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:02.020
Are you really that stupid?

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:04.600
Thank you, Kagami.

00:20:04.600 --> 00:20:06.770
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:10.820
No need to worry. I'm done cleaning up the school.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:14.690
So even if you make new friends here, it won't be because of a Transformation.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.150
You'll have done it on your own.

00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:21.660
So just relax and enjoy
your carefree, exciting school life.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:22.950
Kagami!

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:27.540
I'm sorry, Kagami! I'm such an idiot!

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:30.750
What's wrong with you?

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.300
You're going to get your snot on me.

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:33.670
That's dirty!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:35.760
I'll get those gods to behave!

00:20:36.220 --> 00:20:39.050
I'll make sure you don't have to go through this again!

00:20:39.050 --> 00:20:41.050
So... So...

00:20:43.770 --> 00:20:46.390
You're annoying me, tramp!

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.190
I'm so sorry!

00:20:48.190 --> 00:20:49.900
I love you!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:52.940
You're creeping me out, you swine!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:58.320
Kagami, let's be friends!

00:20:58.910 --> 00:21:00.570
Please, Kagami!

00:21:00.570 --> 00:21:02.330
Not for practice this time.

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:03.910
Let's be real friends!

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:06.660
Sasami-san...

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:12.420
I used to be a puppet.

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:15.880
My mind was empty.

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:19.180
It was frozen cold, incapable of shedding a single teardrop,

00:21:19.550 --> 00:21:25.140
but I still yearned for a normal life.

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:29.770
I wanted to be an ordinary girl who could freely express emotions.

00:21:30.440 --> 00:21:32.860
If my wish could be granted...

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:37.150
God, I wanted to become a human,

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:40.570
foolish and weak, but warm inside.

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:42.620
A true human being.

00:21:43.950 --> 00:21:46.950
Kagami, you're <i>already</i> so warm.

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:51.960
Can I become human?

00:21:52.250 --> 00:21:54.630
Can I be your friend?

00:21:54.630 --> 00:21:56.000
Of course you can.

00:21:56.000 --> 00:21:59.220
Or rather, let's get you there <i>together</i>,

00:21:59.220 --> 00:22:00.300
Kagami.

00:22:03.470 --> 00:22:05.930
Good night, Kagami.

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:17.400
We apologize for a fake Sasami ruining this segment last time.

00:22:17.400 --> 00:22:21.200
The perpetrator responsible was found and savored by the staff.

00:22:21.200 --> 00:22:22.780
What, they ate her?!

00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:28.290
That aside, that fake could only overtake you because you didn't take your duty seriously.

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:29.870
Please try harder.

00:22:29.870 --> 00:22:32.040
I can help you just a little if you need me to.

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:34.210
Then, you should sing with me!

00:22:34.210 --> 00:22:36.920
There are things we can't do alone, but can together!

00:22:37.500 --> 00:22:39.340
Don't be such a baby.

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:42.510
I'll stand here and cheer for you, so just sing the song.

00:22:42.510 --> 00:22:44.260
Just do it. Come on!

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:45.430
Jeez.

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:36.230
Ah, I think it was sort of enjoyable this time.

00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:37.610
I'm worn out.

00:23:37.610 --> 00:23:39.980
I'm not doing something like this ever again.

00:23:43.990 --> 00:23:46.360
Time for the Lazy Quiz.

00:23:46.360 --> 00:23:47.280
Question number one:

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:49.990
What kind of question am I about to ask?

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:50.740
Hint:

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:55.250
It's a very difficult question that nobody in the world could get right.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:57.960
Three, two, one, time.

00:23:57.960 --> 00:23:59.000
Answer:

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:01.500
Whatever you have in mind right now will do.

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:02.260
Question number two:

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:06.130
What's the answer to the question you had in mind?

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:10.260
Next time, episode six: "I'm Only Causing My Parents Trouble."
